  "jobTitle": "Principal Software Engineer",
  "summary": "System software development engineer currently working on Microsoft SQL Server. Contributing to the database engine in the areas of Transaction Service (logging and recovery), Backup/Restore, and Unstructured Data (Filestream and FileTable features). Expertise is in SQL Server internals, mainly in the storage engine, and Windows system programming.\n\nPrior experience includes web application platform&framework and distributed computing. Helped building the backend of Java EE (J2EE) application server including EJB container and ORM(JPA) components. Participated in the standardization of Java EE 5&6 specs through JCP, and in the open source project GlassFish as a committer. \n\nInterests are in system programming including the areas of database engine, cloud computing,  application platform&framework, and distributed systems.\n\nSpecialties: Database engines, Transaction systems, File systems, Windows system programming, Web application platforms/frameworks, Java EE technologies, TCP/IP network programming, Distributed computing.",
