    "description": "Software engineer in SQL Server Database Engine. Focus areas are Transaction processing and Unstructured Data (Filestream and FileTable features).\n\nContributed to SQL Server 2014/2016 Features - Managed Lock Priority and Single Partition Online Index Rebuild, Encrypted Backup, Smart Backup, Tempdb, Filestream, and FileTable.\n\nAlso, participated in Servicing Engineering for SQL Server in-market versions (2008, 2008 R2, 2012, and 2014).",
